      <groundspeak:encoded_hints>6CM BGL .3M W MP 9M E C/L 53ST

ASC CAP 6 CM BGL, 0.3 M W OF MP, LANDSCAPED.9.8 M EAST OF THE C/L OF N-S PAVED 53 ST

